<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amerin said a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amerin said a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Amerin Corp with a buy recommendation, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- 1996 earnings estimate is $1.06 per share and for 1997 it is $1.55 per share, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 20-1/2 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
